  "goodToKnow": "Der Scheinwerfer is a headlight (car) or spotlight and floodlight (stage, stadium): das Fernlicht (full beam), das Abblendlicht (dipped headlights). Im Scheinwerferlicht stehen means to be in the spotlight. Literally, it's a light-thrower: der Schein (glow, shine) + werfen (to throw). Der Schein also means appearance, a certificate and a banknote. Plural: die Scheinwerfer."
